== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @garlic{5/8%clove}, @tomato sauce{7/2%oz}, @butter{1/2%tbsp}, @italian seasoning{1/20%tsp}, @serving(s) parmesan cheese for{}, @salt and pepper{}, @tomato paste{1/2%tbsp}, @heavy/whipping cream{1/5%cup}, @gluten-free pasta{}.

== Preparation ==

Cook the added gluten-free pasta according to its package; its amount needs review. Soften garlic in butter, add tomato paste, tomato sauce and seasoning, then simmer. Stir in cream and combine with pasta; finish with Parmesan.
